      "id": "claim_de50d06954b040929e80079cdac26996",
      "statement": "Brijio's runtime is an explicit request/response chain in which an agent tool call is forwarded by the WebSocket relay to the user's browser session and the structured result flows back; there is no cloned browser or continuously streamed page view.",
