    {
      "id": "claim_cbfc69742594499dad1c94fb57dd4d65",
      "statement": "The WebSocket relay authenticates each connection against the pairing token set (BRIJIO_PAIRING_TOKEN plus additionalPairingTokens), derives a sha256 scope key from the accepted token, answers list_browsers directly from its in-memory presence map, and for other MCP requests selects a browser by target.browserInstanceId (requiring an explicit ID when more than one browser is online) and forwards the full envelope to that extension socket, routing the extension response back to the requesting MCP socket by request id.",
