      "statement": "Chrome and Safari extensions are thin browser-specific adapters around the shared BrijioBackgroundController: each supplies its own chrome.* or browser.* API surface, permission helpers (isRegularPageUrl), approval injection via scripting.executeScript plus tabs.sendMessage, and download/fetch adapters; per ADR 0019 Safari reuses the shared logic with Safari-specific adapters and MV2 background behavior.",
