      "id": "claim_5f54136ee2ff496b9049233352b7e1a3",
      "statement": "The combined brijio binary (servers/mcp/bin/brijio.mjs) starts both the WebSocket relay and the MCP HTTP server in one process, auto-generates BRIJIO_PAIRING_TOKEN and MCP_HTTP_AUTH_TOKEN when unset, mirrors legacy BROWSERBRIDGE_* env vars, manages graceful shutdown on SIGINT/SIGTERM, and dispatches daemon lifecycle commands; daemon config and tokens are stored in ~/.brijio/.env with a LaunchAgent (macOS) or systemd user unit (Linux).",
